---
description: Performance defaults
globs:
  - **
alwaysApply: false
---

- RSC-first in studio
- `'use client'` only when needed
- design: tree-shakeable deep exports
- heavy renderers: `dynamic()` in studio
- `next/image` in image renderers
- no autoplay video junk
- `will-change` only on `transform` / `opacity` / `filter`, only while animating
- virtualise lists beyond ~50 rows
- no layout reads (`getBoundingClientRect`, `offsetWidth`) during render
- `loading="lazy"` below the fold, `priority` above it
- prefer uncontrolled inputs for high-frequency typing
